<%--
No_Load_Gated_Component - Calls gate_load() in on_create() but has NO custom
on_load(). Gates must be ignored: the component must boot to ready without ever
awaiting the (never-resolved) gate, and gate_load() must not throw.
--%>
<Define:No_Load_Gated_Component>
  <div $sid="content">no-load</div>
</Define:No_Load_Gated_Component>
